616600,28107300,25505200,7121200,8731400,3701000,54865200,33926700,67457300,42467500,20457700,17862000,33719700,17395600,106444500,131578700,185442900,106097500,138938900,285893300,40285100,31651600,31900900,22139300,10740900,12014200,9381700,12970000,5823200,16690300,28613500,23323400,31073800,21666000,21074200,15702000,23174900,31846900,9783600,7886000,13249900,12573100,28035800,52534600,24998700,21472300,5590400]}},"profile":{"website":"https://www.securemetric.com","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Infrastructure","employees":142,"city":"Kuala Lumpur","summary":"Securemetric Berhad provides digital security solutions in Malaysia, Vietnam, the Philippines, Indonesia, the United States, Singapore, and internationally. The company operates through Digital Security Solutions, Electronic Identification Products, Maintenance Services, and Others segments. Its products include software licensing protection dongles for the prevention of unauthorized access, copy, imitation, and distribution of software; two-factor authentication that enhances access security by enforcing a second authentication factor through a randomly generated one-time password; public key infrastructure tokens; and CENTAGATE, a software that manages user authentication and supports multi-factor and multichannel authentication, and digital signing solution. The company also trades in electronic identification products and offers other related services. In addition, it sells smart cards, smart card readers, fingerprint readers, barcode scanners, and barcode printers; and provides labelling and packaging services. The company was founded in 2007 and is headquartered in Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia.","zh":"Securemetric Berhad 成立于2007年，总部位于马来西亚吉隆坡，提供数字安全解决方案，业务覆盖马来西亚、越南、菲律宾、印度尼西亚、美国、新加坡及国际市场。公司通过数字安全解决方案、电子识别产品、维护服务及其他部门运营。","lines":["数字安全解决方案：提供软件许可保护加密狗、双因素认证、公钥基础设施令牌及CENTAGATE认证管理软件，客户为需要数字安全的企业。","电子识别产品：销售智能卡、智能卡读卡器、指纹读取器、条码扫描器和条码打印机等产品。","维护服务：提供与数字安全及电子识别产品相关的维护服务。","其他：提供标签和包装服务，以及交易电子识别产品和其他相关服务。"],"lines_en":["Digital Security Solutions: Offers software licensing protection dongles, two-factor authentication, public key infrastructure tokens, and CENTAGATE authentication management software for enterprises requiring digital security.","Electronic Identification Products: Trades smart cards, smart card readers, fingerprint readers, barcode scanners, and barcode printers.","Maintenance Services: Provides maintenance services related to digital security and electronic identification products.","Others: Provides labelling and packaging services, and trades electronic identification products and other related services."]}}